00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:21.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, so I'm thinking that we keep the same time, so 4 p.m. your time, but we shift to Thursdays, if that happens to work for you.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.000
Steve’s iPhone: Uh, yeah, that should be fine.

